[l_english.STATE_LORE_528]
The Everfree Forest, also known as the Forest of Eternal Freedom, is home to countless wondrous jungle creatures. From the Deer of the Thicket to the Flash Bees, from the Vines to the Rabid Rhododendrons, every sight in the forest constantly reminds you of its name: Ever, Free. Please, do not mistake this name for some abstract symbolism, because if you ignore its literal meaning, the countless armies you send to manage and control this forest will quietly be consumed by it.
Even during Celestia’s time, the Kingdom of Thicket in the heart of Equestria enjoyed its independence – under the leadership of King Aspen, the Deer of the Thicket established a hidden kingdom deep inside the Everfree Forest. Like the aspen trees, even extraterrestrial forces from Andalusian couldn’t shake them, let alone minotaur contractors, Equestria’s princesses, Lords of Chaos, or self-proclaimed Empresses. The deer could stand with the ponies to resist terrifying monsters, or they could stand against the ponies, fiercely repelling those greedy ones who sought to invade the Everfree Forest; all of this was their freedom. Now, the Lord of Chaos who is stripped of his magic, the witches of the jungle, and high school students from another world have all recognized their mutual threat from the Empress of Canterlot, forming a loose, temporary alliance and promised King Aspen the restoration of Thicket’s tranquility in exchange for sanctuary and support.
So far, they haven’t succeeded. Thicket, as an observer, has invested nothing and lost nothing. The future of this alliance remains uncertain, but one thing is for sure: those who try to tame the Everfree Forest will ultimately become a part of it, forever.

[l_simp_chinese.STATE_LORE_528]
无尽之森，又称永恒自由森林，其中生活着无数奇妙的丛林生物。从丛林鹿族到闪光蜂，从藤蔓到疯狂杜鹃，森林中的一切景象无时无刻不在向你提醒着它的名字：永恒自由。请千万不要以为这个名字代表着什么高尚的象征意义，因为当你忽略了它的字面含义，你派去管理与控制森林地区的无数军队就会悄悄地被这座森林吞噬。
早在塞拉斯蒂娅时期，位于小马利亚王国腹地的灌丛谷王国就享有着他们的永恒自由——在白杨王的领导下，丛林鹿族们在无尽之森中的灌丛谷建立了隐秘的王国。正如白杨树一般，即使是来自安达卢西亚的外星势力也未能动摇他们，更别提什么牛头族的承包商、小马利亚的公主、混沌领主或是什么自命的女皇了。鹿族们既可以与小马们站在一起，反抗那些恐怖的怪物；也可以站在小马的对面，对那些妄图侵占无尽之森的贪婪者施以猛烈的回击，这都是它们的自由。如今，已经失去魔力的混沌领主、丛林中的女巫、来自异世界的高中生，都意识到了来自坎特洛特女皇的威胁，暂时性地组成了松散的同盟并许诺白杨王恢复灌丛谷的宁静，换取庇护与支持。
至少到目前为止，他们没能成功。灌丛谷作为旁观者，也并未投入或损失什么。这个同盟的未来充满不确定性，但有一点是肯定的：那些试图驯服无尽之森者，最终都会成为它的无尽的一部分。
